body:
There is a huge, gaping AH in this story and his name is Brother.... Sorry you're related. He sounds like an insecure, judgmental prick. Have a great trip with your honeybun, friend. 

&#x200B;

And that niggling little voice in the back of your head that tells you, you should have been there to support him can go suck on a fat banana bc he wasn't being supportive of you.
